# The Spout2 SDK is fetched + SHA-verified by scripts/fetch-spout.ps1 (see SUPPLY_CHAIN.md).
# EXCEPTION: the PATCHED SpoutLibrary.dll IS committed (with its .patched SHA marker + the
# source patch) - the official binary fatally __fastfail's on GL/DX interop failure; the
# committed one is built by scripts/build-spout-dll.ps1 and the fetch scripts keep it.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!patches/
!patches/**
!bin/
!bin/SpoutLibrary.dll
!bin/SpoutLibrary.dll.patched
